      "zh": "重散景光斑",
      "en": "heavy bokeh rendering, large out-of-focus highlight discs, aperture-shaped blur circles, pronounced background or foreground defocus highlights, optical blur balls",
      "desc": "讓離焦高光形成大型光斑或光圈形狀，重點是散景形狀、尺寸與離焦高光的光學表現。",
