      ],
      "zh": "旋渦散景 Swirly Bokeh",
      "en": "swirly bokeh rendering, curved out-of-focus background highlights circling around the subject, vintage edge swirl, rotational peripheral blur character",
      "desc": "背景散景在畫面邊緣形成旋繞流動感，重點是復古鏡頭式的周邊旋渦散景，而不是單純背景模糊。",
