      ],
      "zh": "貓眼散景 Cat-eye Bokeh",
      "en": "cat-eye bokeh rendering, oval edge highlights near the frame perimeter, lens-edge compression of blur discs, stretched off-axis background bokeh",
      "desc": "畫面邊緣的散景光斑被拉成貓眼形橢圓，重點是離軸位置的鏡頭邊緣散景特徵。",
