      ],
      "zh": "稜鏡折射 Prism Refraction",
      "en": "prism refraction effect, split-image fragments, rainbow spectral streaks, duplicated edge reflections, crystalline light scattering near the frame",
      "desc": "利用稜鏡或折射介質讓畫面邊緣出現分裂影像、彩虹色譜與晶體式反射碎片。",
      "meta": {
        "semantic": {
          "tags": [
            "refraction_artifact"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
