      ],
      "zh": "星芒光圈 Starburst",
      "en": "starburst diffraction spikes on bright point lights, crisp radiating light rays, stopped-down aperture sparkle, sharp multi-point highlight stars",
      "desc": "明亮點光源產生清楚放射狀星芒，重點是光圈繞射形成的多角星形高光。",
