        "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:變形鏡頭光斑-anamorphic-flare:10"
      ],
      "zh": "變形鏡頭光斑 Anamorphic Flare",
      "en": "anamorphic lens flare artifacts, horizontal flare streaks, cylindrical lens reflection behavior, oval bokeh response, stretched optical highlights",
      "desc": "變形鏡頭造成水平 flare、橢圓散景與被拉伸的高光反射，重點是柱面光學特徵。",
