      ],
      "zh": "局部炫光霧面反差",
      "en": "localized veiling flare, partial low-contrast haze around strong light entry, washed highlight patching, matte glare bloom without full-frame fog",
      "desc": "局部強光進入鏡頭後形成一塊對比下降的霧面炫光區，像鍍膜失守或半片式 glare，而不是整張都起霧。",
      "meta": {
        "semantic": {
          "tags": [
            "light_artifact",
            "flare_artifact",
            "optical_haze"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
