      "legacyIds": [
        "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:漏光效果-light-leaks:12"
      ],
      "zh": "漏光效果 Light Leaks",
      "en": "analog film light leak artifacts, irregular edge exposure burns, translucent red-orange film-gate leaks, uneven accidental exposure streaks, frame-edge chemical light contamination",
      "desc": "模擬底片或膠片匣漏光造成的不規則邊緣曝光、暖色光痕與局部化學感覆蓋。",
      "meta": {
        "semantic": {
          "tags": [
            "analog_artifact",
            "light_leak"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
