        "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:柔焦濾鏡-soft-focus:13"
      ],
      "zh": "柔焦濾鏡 Soft Focus",
      "en": "soft focus diffusion filter, lowered microcontrast, softened fine detail, gentle glow around high-contrast edges, preserved overall facial and subject structure",
      "desc": "柔焦或擴散濾鏡降低微對比與細節銳度，在高反差邊緣產生柔和暈散，但仍保留主體結構。",
      "meta": {
        "semantic": {
          "tags": [
            "soft_focus",
            "diffusion_filter"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
