        "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:霧化高光-bloom:14"
      ],
      "zh": "霧化高光 Bloom",
      "en": "highlight bloom, halation around bright areas, local luminance bleeding, softened highlight edges, optical glow spill limited to high-value regions",
      "desc": "高亮區域邊緣向外暈散，形成局部亮度溢出與 halation，重點是高光反應而非整體場景狀態。",
      "meta": {
        "semantic": {
          "tags": [
            "bloom",
            "halation"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
