        "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:暗角-vignette:15"
      ],
      "zh": "暗角 Vignette",
      "en": "optical vignetting, darker frame corners, radial edge exposure falloff, center-weighted brightness, subtle lens shading toward the image perimeter",
      "desc": "鏡頭邊緣進光量下降，畫面角落與邊緣呈現徑向變暗，中心亮度相對更集中。",
