      "id": "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:邊緣模糊:17",
      "legacyIds": [
        "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:邊緣模糊:17"
      ],
      "zh": "邊緣模糊",
      "en": "peripheral edge blur, center sharpness with soft frame edges, field curvature softness, reduced corner resolution, lens falloff away from the image center",
      "desc": "中心解析較高，越接近畫面邊緣越柔，模擬場曲、邊角解析下降或鏡頭周邊成像衰減。",
      "meta": {
        "semantic": {
          "tags": [
            "edge_blur"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:中央清晰邊緣拉抹:18",
      "legacyIds": [
        "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:中央清晰邊緣拉抹:18"
      ],
      "zh": "中央清晰邊緣拉抹",
      "en": "sharp center with smeared frame edges, radial edge stretching, directional peripheral blur, center-held subject clarity, warped outer image field",
      "desc": "中央主體相對清楚，但畫面外圈有明顯方向性拉抹與扭曲，像低品質濾鏡或實驗鏡片造成的邊緣拖拽感。",
      "meta": {
        "semantic": {
          "tags": [
            "edge_blur"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:光學朦朧薄霧:19",
      "legacyIds": [
        "camera:光學效果-optical-effects:光學朦朧薄霧:19"
      ],
      "zh": "光學朦朧薄霧",
      "en": "lens-only mist-filter haze, veiling glare, lowered global contrast, softened black levels, diffused highlight edges, optical diffusion layer",
      "desc": "像鏡頭前加了 mist 濾鏡或產生遮蔽眩光，使整體對比下降、黑位抬高與高光邊緣變柔；重點是鏡頭濾鏡感，不是場景天氣。",
      "meta": {
        "semantic": {
          "tags": [
            "optical_haze",
            "diffusion_filter",
            "softened_black_levels"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
